auth {
  mode: inherit
}

docs {
  Provider callbacks. Unauthenticated by URL and authenticated by signature.

  Not rate limited: throttling a gateway into giving up loses payment confirmations, which is worse
  than serving the requests.

  The `mock` provider needs no signature and exists for exactly this -- exercising the settle path
  without a real gateway. It is only registered outside production.
}
